---
const facts = [
  { value: "1993", label: "In practice since" },
  { value: "20+", label: "Vertical markets" },
  { value: "12", label: "Countries" },
];
---
<section class="wrap band" id="about">
  <p class="label rv">Who Is Wyckoff</p>
  <h2 class="about2__name rv" aria-label="Luke Wyckoff">Luke <span class="outline">Wyckoff</span></h2>
  <div class="about2__grid">
    <figure class="about2__figure">
      <div class="about2__media" id="aboutMedia">
        <img src="/images/luke.jpg" alt="Luke Wyckoff, Fractional Chief Marketing Officer" loading="lazy" />
        <span class="about2__tint" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <figcaption class="about2__quote">&ldquo;Without margin, there is no mission.&rdquo;</figcaption>
      </div>
      <span class="about2__side" aria-hidden="true">Fractional CMO &mdash; Est. 1993</span>
    </figure>
    <div class="about2__body rv">
      <p>A creative operator with a finance background, placed on your executive team in a part-time capacity. What you get is an unbiased expert whose only focus is growth and profitability.</p>
      <p>Since 1993, Wyckoff has worked across more than 20 vertical markets in 12 countries, executing marketing strategies that drive owners' equity and shareholder value. The catch: you can't hire him as a W2.</p>
      <div class="about2__facts">
        {facts.map((f) => (
          <div class="about2__fact"><b>{f.value}</b><span>{f.label}</span></div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div class="about2__prompt">
        <a class="textlink" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/lukewyckoff/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Do you already know someone who knows Wyckoff?<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about2__prompt {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .about2__prompt .textlink {
    max-width: 100%;
    white-space: normal;
  }
</style>
